Build backend incidence storage from a {@link TopoDS_Shape | `TopoDS_Shape`}.
@param theStorage storage to populate (cleared first)
@param theShape root shape
@param theParallel if true, face-level extraction runs in parallel
@param theOptions optional post-pass controls
@param theParamLayer optional point-rep layer to populate
@param theRegularityLayer optional edge-regularity layer to populate
@param theTmpAlloc optional allocator for temporary scratch data

Extend existing backend storage with additional shapes (no clear). Flattens hierarchy containers away; Solid/Shell/Compound/CompSolid inputs contribute appended face roots instead of container entities. Recomputes the built-in metadata layers from the populated storage.
@param theStorage storage to extend
@param theShape shape to append
@param theParallel if true, face-level extraction runs in parallel
@param theAppendedRoots collected root NodeIds for non-container shapes Mutated in place; read the updated value from this argument after the call.
@param theOptions optional post-pass controls
@param theTmpAlloc optional allocator for temporary scratch data

Extend existing backend storage with additional shapes (no clear). Preserves the full shape hierarchy: Solid/Shell/Compound/CompSolid nodes are created alongside Face/Edge/Vertex nodes. Shapes already present in the storage (same TShape pointer) are deduplicated and not re-added.
@param theStorage storage to extend
@param theShape shape to append
@param theParallel if true, face-level extraction runs in parallel
@param theOptions optional post-pass controls
@param theTmpAlloc optional allocator for temporary scratch data

Reconstruct a {@link TopoDS_Shape | `TopoDS_Shape`} from an entity node. Creates a local cache internally; shared vertices/edges are not reused across calls.
@param theStorage incidence storage
@param theNode entity node id
@returns reconstructed shape

Reconstruct a {@link TopoDS_Shape | `TopoDS_Shape`} with a shared cache for sub-shape reuse. Vertices and edges already in theCache are returned directly.
@param theStorage incidence storage
@param theNode entity node id
@param theCache shared cache for vertex/edge/face shapes Mutated in place; read the updated value from this argument after the call.
@returns reconstructed shape

Reconstruct a face with shared edge/vertex cache for multi-face contexts.
@param theStorage incidence storage
@param theFaceId face entity id
@param theCache shared cache for edge and vertex shapes Mutated in place; read the updated value from this argument after the call.
@returns reconstructed face shape

